# Cursor & Grok Rules — justccell.com

Read `rules.md`, `AGENTS.md`, and `features-code-map.md` (Rule §0.5) before making changes.

## 🚨 MANDATORY HARD RULE: Codebase map + 100% Backend Content Editability
**0. Codebase map:** Before modifying or auditing theme code, read `features-code-map.md` for exact paths. After you write, refactor, or fix a feature, update that file with new paths, functions, hooks, and meta keys in the same turn. The task is not complete until the map is synchronized.

Every page and template created or modified on justccell.com MUST be completely editable from the WordPress backend edit screen (`Pages → Edit Page` / `Products → Edit Product`):
1. **Headings, Subheadings, Paragraphs, Button Text / CTA Labels, Button URLs, and Media** MUST be wired to backend fields.
2. **Native WP & WooCommerce first:** Use native Page Title, Content, Excerpt, Featured Image, Woo Product Title, Descriptions, Prices, Attributes, Gallery.
3. **ACF fields mandatory if native is not sufficient — GUI + Local JSON ONLY:** Any custom section, card, grid, or CTA button must be mapped to an ACF field **created/edited in the wp-admin ACF GUI and synced to `acf-json/` via Local JSON**. 🚨 **MASTER ACF RULE:** Defining or registering fields with hardcoded PHP arrays (`acf_add_local_field_group([...])`) is **strictly forbidden**. `inc/acf-*.php` is **plumbing only** (JSON load/save paths, location-rule filters, `acf/prepare_field` UI tweaks, one-time repair/seed helpers).
4. **NO HARDCODED COPY OR BUTTONS:** Never hardcode marketing copy, section headlines, or button labels in PHP templates or JavaScript. PHP defaults may only serve as fallbacks when fields are empty.
5. **ZERO LEFTOVER ACF FIELDS & STRICT 1:1 SYNC:** Always clean up and delete leftover or deprecated ACF fields **in the wp-admin ACF GUI (which updates `acf-json/`)** whenever a page or section is modified. Never leave dead schemas in `acf-json/` or orphan `acf-field` rows in the DB. Every front-end field must have an active backend field, and every backend field must be rendered on the front end (no ghost fields).
6. **ZERO 'GET SAMPLES & QUOTES' (Strict Client Ban):** Per client instruction (Mr Nas): *"Anywhere you see get samples and quotes on the whole site please remove. Its not something we offer."* Never output sample offerings, sample requests, or sample turnaround promises anywhere on the site. Use standard business inquiry CTAs ("Inquire Now", "Get in Touch", "Contact Us").
7. **Obsidian second memory & graph integrity:** After shipping, update `docs/STATUS.md`, `docs/BUILD-LOG.md`, `features-code-map.md` (if files/hooks moved), and `rules.md` in the same turn. Every created `.md` note MUST have line 1 `> **Parent Hub:** [[...]] · [[INDEX|🧠 Master Ai Brain Hub]]` and be linked in `INDEX.md`. **Zero naked hashes in prose** (wrap `#XXXX`, `#123`, `#TODO`, hex colors in backticks) to prevent phantom Obsidian tag nodes from floating disconnected in graph view.
8. **Canonical bio URL:** **`/cell-3-0/`** (Just CCELL 3.0), resolved by the Justccell 3.0 page template. Legacy `/justccell-3-0/`, `/ccell-3-0/`, `/ccell-3.0/`, `/justccell-3.0/` **301 into `/cell-3-0/`** — never the reverse (`justccell_bio_canonical_slug()` returns `cell-3-0`). See rules.md §7.5.
9. **PDP SEO:** Product heading = H1, Product Tagline = H2, Specs = H3 + ul. Woo Product description is the long-copy field. Virtual PDP/listing routes self-canonicalize via `justccell_rank_math_view_canonical()` (rules.md §7.11). Canonicals only render once the site is indexable (launch: uncheck Settings → Reading "Discourage search engines").
10. **Elite Terpenes cross-sell (live):** After processing/completed, `inc/elite-cross-sell.php` POSTs a 48h free-delivery coupon to eliteterpenez.com. Settings: **Justccell → Elite Cross-sell**. Never block checkout (Action Scheduler + 4s timeout). Elite plugin is `justccell-coupon-bridge` on Hostinger `u984013785` — not this account. Spec: `docs/elite-cross-sell.md`. Reverse `ET-{order_id}` is not built. Never commit REST secrets.

## Live Theme & Deploy Rules
- **Live theme folder:** `wp-content/themes/justccell-theme/` (Never create hashed theme copies).
- **In-place updates:** Deploy changed files via TUS to `public_html/wp-content/themes/justccell-theme/{relative-path}`.
- **Version bump:** Bump `JUSTCCELL_VERSION` in `functions.php` and `style.css` on asset changes.
- **Clear cache:** Always purge Hostinger website cache and LiteSpeed cache after shipping.
- **Media Library only:** Front-end images/videos must be attachments; no theme `/assets/img/...` paths or hotlinks in production markup.
- **Zero footprint of ccell.com:** Never link, mention, or leak design-source URLs in public HTML/CSS/JS.
